[header]
missionType = "Tutorial"
missionNumber = 1
moreGeysers = 1
myStartMoney = 800
myTech="thunderbattery;bulf;thunderblocker;

ai2Name = "Kukulkan"
ai2Tech="windbattery;windblocker;windarcher;windballoon;windwalker;
ai2StartMoney = 1000
ai2GeyserAttachments = 8
ai2Collectors = 12
ai2TimeBetweenMoves = 2

title = "Survival"

[Options]
[A.]
<h2>Survival</h2>
<br><i>~IOmnia sunt miseria in bellis civilibus, sed miserius nihil quam ipsa victoria. 
~--Cicero<br></i>
<p>
Your kingdom is running dangerously low on stormpower, and an enemy island has besieged you.
With only one type of technology you can't survive. Your only hope is to gather enough 
stormpower to pay for espionage missions, and aquire advanced types of technologies.
$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
Note:
<br>Only by gathering enough stormpower will you be able to conduct espionage missions.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Start Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=Bail,MissionAbort,1

[@100]
Looks like you've aquired some stormpower, now shall we conduct
espionage missions?
$Button=Sure,Tell,ESP1
$Button=I don't know,DoNothing,0

[ESP1]
<h2>Success!</h2>
Technology stolen!
$Button=Let's see it,GetTechnology,131

[@200]
Do you want to preform more espionage missions?
$Button=Yes,Tell,Yes
$Button=No,DoNothing,0

[Yes]
Your spies have managed to steal 3 technologies, and you can choose
which one you want.
$Button=Wind,GetTechnology,75
$Button=Rain,GetTechnology,76
$Button=Thunder,GetTechnology,148

[@300]
Send spies?
$Button=Yes,Tell,Sure
$Button=No,DoNothing,0

[Sure]
Technology stolen!
You may choose of the following:
$Button=Wind,GetTechnology,140
$Button=Rain,GetTechnology,147
$Button=Thunder,GetTechnology,149
$Button=Sun,GetTechnology,128
$Button=Sun1,GetTechnology,136
$Button=Sun2,GetTechnology,71

[@400]
Send spies?
$Button=Sure,Tell,Send
$Button=No,DoNothing,0

[Send]
<h2>Failiure</h2>
Your Spies have been caught in action and have been executed.
$Button=That's not good,DoNothing,0
$Button=Send Spies Again,Tell,SendSpies

[SendSpies]
<h2>Mission Successful</h2>
Your new spies have succeeded in stealing a technology from the enemy.
$Button=Let's see what they've got,Tell,Got

[Got]
The following technologies were stolen:
$Button=Sun,GetTechnology,111
$Button=Sun1,GetTechnology,136
$Button=Wind,GetTechnolog,142

[@500]
<h2>A message from the <i>~renemy</i></h2>
"So I see, that you've been spying a lot on me lateley.
That isn't very nice of you. I shall put a stronger guard this time
so that we won't have more of these incidents. 'Cause we don't want
YOU to gain any of our technology, now, do we?
$Button=What ever,DoNothing,0
$Button=O.K.,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
You've won! Even though the odds were on the side of enemy, you've managed to come
out victorious from this battle.
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Alliance
$Button=Leave Mission,MissionAbort,1

[Failed]
<h2>Failiure!</h2>
You've failed to achieve victory!
$Button=Try Again,Tell,TryAgain